Revision history for DBD-ClickhouseNG

0.50   2026-07-20
       - Catalog/introspection: table_info, column_info, type_info_all,
         primary_key_info.
       - Bounded-batch streaming fetch for large result sets
         (fetch_batch_rows).
       - TLS/SSL support, including an opt-in insecure mode (tls_insecure).
       - get_info, data_sources, ParamArrays, ChopBlanks.
       - CPAN packaging cleanup: LICENSE file (Artistic 1.0 / GPL v3+),
         MANIFEST brought back in sync with the shipped test suite.

0.001  2026-07-19
       - Initial implementation per DESIGN.md.
